  "description": "Beau didn’t know what to do when he found an alien passed out in his front yard. Tentacles sprouting from his head, leaves for ears, his name is Heinrich the DESTROYER OF WORLDS, and he has an insatiable appetite for MEAT. Hailing from the plant planet of Vegetan, he came to conquer Earth and eat its meat (in that order) but with Beau, he finds something else to satisfy his hunger…love. Bet you were thinking something else, huh? A botanical boy love comedy for carnivores, vegetarians, and weird plant aliens alike! \n (Source: Webtoon Guide)",
